#. Key:	EEC78ED4462D440551FEC3A411789B5E
#. SourceLocation:	/Cartograph/Cartograph_Config.Default__Cartograph_Config_C:BP_ConfigPropertySection_C_0.BP_ConfigPropertyFloat_C_0.DisplayName
#: /Cartograph/Cartograph_Config.Default__Cartograph_Config_C:BP_ConfigPropertySection_C_0.BP_ConfigPropertyFloat_C_0.DisplayName
msgctxt ",EEC78ED4462D440551FEC3A411789B5E"
msgid "Initialize Time Budget"
msgstr "초기화 작업 시간 허용치"

#. Key:	8127403948FA84279358CCBA2D1967F6
#. SourceLocation:	/Cartograph/Cartograph_Config.Default__Cartograph_Config_C:BP_ConfigPropertySection_C_0.BP_ConfigPropertyFloat_C_0.Tooltip
#: /Cartograph/Cartograph_Config.Default__Cartograph_Config_C:BP_ConfigPropertySection_C_0.BP_ConfigPropertyFloat_C_0.Tooltip
msgctxt ",8127403948FA84279358CCBA2D1967F6"
msgid "Allowed work time in ms per tick(frame) for initialization which happens when a world is loaded. Higher = Laggier for the first few frames but Faster initialization(first map render)."
msgstr "월드 로드 후 초기화 시 틱(프레임)당 허용되는 작업 시간 (단위: ms). 값이 높을수록 처음 몇 프레임의 랙이 심해지지만 초기화(첫 맵 렌더링)가 더 빨라집니다."

#. Key:	3CDD6E7546489FF5AC430489672FE7E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Cartograph/Cartograph_Config.Default__Cartograph_Config_C:BP_ConfigPropertySection_C_0.BP_ConfigPropertyFloat_C_1.DisplayName
#: /Cartograph/Cartograph_Config.Default__Cartograph_Config_C:BP_ConfigPropertySection_C_0.BP_ConfigPropertyFloat_C_1.DisplayName
msgctxt ",3CDD6E7546489FF5AC430489672FE7E1"
msgid "Redraw Time Budget"
msgstr "맵 갱신 작업 시간 허용치"

#. Key:	B30F0F4541A5E10BE9D87886CF39197C
#. SourceLocation:	/Cartograph/Cartograph_Config.Default__Cartograph_Config_C:BP_ConfigPropertySection_C_0.BP_ConfigPropertyFloat_C_1.Tooltip
#: /Cartograph/Cartograph_Config.Default__Cartograph_Config_C:BP_ConfigPropertySection_C_0.BP_ConfigPropertyFloat_C_1.Tooltip
msgctxt ",B30F0F4541A5E10BE9D87886CF39197C"
msgid "Allowed work time in ms per tick(frame) for redrawing which happens when a building is newly built/dismantled. Higher = Laggier when buildings are built/dismantled but Faster redraw."
msgstr "건물이 새로 지어지거나 철거됐을 때 맵 갱신 시 틱(프레임)당 허용되는 작업 시간 (단위: ms). 값이 높을수록 건물이 새로 지어지거나 철거됐을 때 랙이 심해지지만 갱신이 더 빨라집니다."

